    "Hide Others": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隐藏其他人"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hide the background behind a layer mask, keeping the foreground subjects. The pixels stay, so the background can be painted back at any time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将背景隐藏在图层蒙版后面，保留前景主体。像素会保留下来，因此可以随时重新绘制背景。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "High": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Highlight Clipping Indicator": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高光剪切指示器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Highlight Priority protects bright edges. Color Priority also reduces color. Paint Overlay covers the edges evenly.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高光优先保护明亮的边缘。颜色优先也会减少颜色。油漆覆盖均匀地覆盖边缘。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Highlights": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "亮点"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Histogram": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "直方图"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold Shift to add or Option to subtract for one outline": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按住 Shift 键添加或按住 Option 键减去一个轮廓"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How bright the lines are where the picture is black, so they show even over black": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "图片黑色处的线条有多亮，因此即使在黑色上也能显示出来"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far a color may be from the picked ones and still be selected": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "颜色与所选颜色相差多远但仍会被选择"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far apart the screen's lines are": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "屏幕的线条相距多远"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far each color channel (0–255) can differ from the clicked color and still be selected": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个颜色通道 (0–255) 可以与单击的颜色相差多远，但仍会被选中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the blur softens, in pixels": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模糊柔化的程度（以像素为单位）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the brightness is smoothed before it displaces the lines, from sharp ridges to rounded hills": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "亮度在取代线条（从尖锐的山脊到圆形的山丘）之前平滑了多远"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of each pixel's error spreads to its neighbors. Less gives flatter areas": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个像素的误差有多少传播到其相邻像素。更少会产生更平坦的区域"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of the gap a bright line fills; dimmer parts draw it thinner": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "亮线填补了多少空白；调光部件使其更薄"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HSL lists every color. Color edits one family. Point Color adjusts a color you pick.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HSL 列出了每种颜色。色彩编辑一个家庭。点颜色调整您选择的颜色。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
