        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "线性"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Linear histogram with automatic vertical scaling. Tall spikes may extend beyond the graph; all tones from 0 to 255 remain included.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "具有自动垂直缩放功能的线性直方图。高尖峰可能会超出图表范围； 0 到 255 之间的所有音调仍然包括在内。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Linear runs along the line; Radial spreads out from the start point": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "沿线直线运行；从起点开始呈放射状展开"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Liquify pushes pixels · Blur softens · Smudge drags color along": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "液化推动像素 · 模糊柔化 · 涂抹拖动颜色"
